    "updated_at": "2022-12-15T02:01:44Z",
    "body": "It seems pretty clear that mode, delegatesFocus, and slotAssignment should be copied. But what about other states like default ARIA role? We probably don't want to preserve ARIA node relationship since newly cloned node may have relationship with other cloned nodes but default ARIA role should probably be copied.",
